  "remarks": "Rustakt LLC is a Russian entity involved in the import of components for Unmanned Aerial Vehicles (UAVs), and in the assembly of UAVs. Rustakt LLC manufactures VT-40 First Person View (FPV) drones and supplies them to the Russian Armed Forces for use in Ukraine. Therefore, Rustakt LLC is supporting Russia’s military and industrial complex.",
